# INV-002: every endpoint reaching a write has a test reaching its handler. Rows are counterexamples.
writes(E) :- Endpoint(E), HANDLED_BY(E, H), reach(H, F, "(CALLS|INJECTS)*", max_hops=8), WRITES_TO(F, T).
tested(E) :- HANDLED_BY(E, H), reach(H, X, "CALLED_BY*", max_hops=8), TESTED_BY(X, T).
?- writes(E), not tested(E) scope Endpoint.
